{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e03-scene-20",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "幸好我还有你  (Luckily I Still Have You)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back on campus, classmate Qin Xiao hurries up to Bu Xiaogu after hearing from Professor Fang that Xiaogu never handed in her master's thesis. Listen to their Mandarin conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "小谷，你怎么了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我听方老师说，你没交论文。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我昨天晚上在公安局过的夜，论文没写。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我去星天入职之前，我有梦想，有学业，每天都特别幸福。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那现在呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "学位没了，事业也完了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那你的偶像呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "偶像这个事我得想想，偶像碎了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "没什么大不了的，别怕啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "不是什么都难不倒布小谷吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "幸好我还有你。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "小谷，你怎么了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, what happened to you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我听方老师说，你没交论文。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I heard from Professor Fang that you did not hand in your thesis.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我昨天晚上在公安局过的夜，论文没写。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I spent last night at the police station and never wrote my thesis.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我去星天入职之前，我有梦想，有学业，每天都特别幸福。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Before joining Xingtian, I had dreams, my studies, and happiness every single day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那现在呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what about now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "学位没了，事业也完了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My degree is gone, and my career is finished too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那你的偶像呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then what about your idol?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "偶像这个事我得想想，偶像碎了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I need to think about my idol; that idol is shattered.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "没什么大不了的，别怕啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is no big deal; do not be afraid.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "不是什么都难不倒布小谷吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Can anything ever stump Bu Xiaogu?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "幸好我还有你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Luckily I still have you.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "小谷，你怎么了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我听方老师说，你没交论文。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我昨天晚上在公安局过的夜，论文没写。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我去星天入职之前，我有梦想，有学业，每天都特别幸福。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那现在呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "学位没了，事业也完了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那你的偶像呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "偶像这个事我得想想，偶像碎了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "没什么大不了的，别怕啊。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "不是什么都难不倒布小谷吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "幸好我还有你。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Even after losing her degree, her internship, and her illusions in a single night, Xiaogu draws comfort from Qin Xiao's encouragement. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
